# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore, revert
# Scopes:
#   core
#   config
#   providers
#   store
#   tui
#   report
#   update
#   build
#   ci
#   deps
#   ai-infra
#
# - imperative mood, lowercase, no trailing period
# - body: explain what and why (blank line after subject)
# - footer: BREAKING CHANGE: <desc>, Closes: #NN
# - breaking change: use ! after type/scope or BREAKING CHANGE: footer
# - release-please: feat bumps minor; fix bumps patch; breaking bumps major
# - rebase merges: every commit lands on main individually and release-please reads each one,
#   so each commit subject becomes a changelog entry; keep commits meaningful and one concern each
